# Multi-Agent Critic System (Phase 2 TEPP)

## 🔍 Project Overview
This project implements a multi-agent system designed to evaluate business processes and generate actionable recommendations. The Critic Agent analyzes structured inputs, identifies inefficiencies, and produces insights that support decision-making.

## 🎯 Problem Addressed
Support teams often rely on manual review processes that slow down operations and create bottlenecks. This project automates evaluation to reduce review time and improve clarity.

## 🧠 Approach
- Python-based multi-agent architecture
- Critic Agent with rule-based and prompt-driven logic
- CSV datasets simulating real business scenarios
- Automated structured recommendations

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies
Python • Pandas • Git/GitHub • VS Code

## 📈 Results
- Automated business process evaluation
- Reduced manual review time
- Clear, structured recommendations

